      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>TO BRING PEOPLE TOGETHER TO TAKE ACTION AND BUILD SUPPORT FOR PROJECTS ADVANCING SOCIAL CHANGE.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>We activate out in the community by producing events and creating content that amplifies our platform as a voice for the causes we stand for. We are committed to walking the talk, showing up in our communities, leading by example. We believe change happens one person at a time. It's impossible to help everyone, so we focus on one individual at a time, knowing that every act of compassion creates a ripple with no definitive end. Our purpose is to inspire deliberate and daily action toward helping others, turning compassion into action. One Love Movement proudly supports a shelter in Bangalore, India, where we care for children who move in and out of the shelter and continue to support them as they grow into young adults and age out of government care. Our funding covers essentials such as food, toiletries, medical needs, and school tuition, along with doctor visits, dental and eye care, gas for cooking, shelter furnishings, and extracurricular activities that nurture joy and growth. In addition, One Love Movement supports critical causes including mental health awareness, equality, human rights, refugee assistance, and expanding opportunity and access to resources for underprivileged youth.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
